x":0.099509962735487054},{"c":1,"t":"gaining more than 8% on 2016 than 2015. The value increases from more than 50 billions to more","x":0.099465519587231196,"y":0.36272976148472846,"h":0.022751093061378347,"w":0.80292953491210928},{"t":"than 6o billions in just a year. This statistic also conclude that the engineers in the country have","y":0.38660770700592184,"w":0.79118774414062498,"c":1,"x":0.099616855931555878,"h":0.01895135818066962},{"h":0.01895135818066962,"w":0.25095784505208329,"t":"gained more by the year 2016.","x":0.099616862706238013,"y":0.40840176879783185,"c":1},{"h":0.021949169233638988,"c":1,"y":0.43617724077365927,"w":0.81809244791666669,"x":0.099569839841798471,"t":"Besides that, agricultural products and textiles also earned more with 0.81% and 15.24% respectively."},{"c":1,"h":0.022982106356400855,"x":0.099549276305098244,"y":0.45772555902199152,"t":"Even though, agricultural products does not gain more than 1%, it stills conclude that the products","w":0.80665313720703113},{"x":0.099616856387278102,"h":0.018951358180669509,"c":1,"y":0.48104864171829598,"t":"are still wanted by many people as it earned about more than 30 billions for both years.","w":0.71839080810546874},{"y":0.5101073907748741,"h":0.020530638029058745,"x":0.099616869251178172,"w":0.78352488199869785,"t":"While for textures, it is seen that it gains it popularity in the year 2016. This is proved, when the","c":1},{"h":0.018970640113816106,"w":0.79118774414062509,"c":1,"t":"statistic states that the earning was increased by more than 15.24% in the year 2016 based on the","y":0.53190145280707246,"x":0.099616855881185226},{"w":0.80091395060221338,"h":0.021302284052759024,"t":"year 2015. Textiles products earned about more than 25 billions in 2015 and earned more than 30","x":0.097627151658424227,"c":1,"y":0.55181535645284696},{"c":1,"x":0.099005869378948674,"y":0.57329181814705377,"w":0.20039243062337236,"t":"billions in the next year.","h":0.020698207582918404},{"t":"In conclusio